  "job_B1.8.4.4_20251001_193259": {
    "chunk_text": "o bec mid lufe Iudas se apostol awrat anne pistol, na se forlorena Iudas \u00fee \u00f0one H\u00e6lend bel\u00e6wde, ac se halga Iudas And her sind nu seofon bec on \u00feissere gesetnisse. Paulus se apostol awrat manega pistolas, for \u00fean \u00fee Crist hine gesette eallum \u00feeodum to lareowe, & Fiftyne pistolas awrat se an apostol to \u00feam leodscipum, \u00fee he to geleafan gebigde; \u00fea syndon micele He awrat to \u00feam Romaniscum anne, to Corinthios ii, eac to Galathas anne, to Ephesios anne, to Be \u00feam ic wille secgan sume feawa word; \u00e6rest be \u00f0am H\u00e6lende, hu he us l\u00e6rde on his halgan Se \u00fee me lufa\u00f0, he healt mine spr\u00e6ce & min F\u00e6der hine lufa\u00f0 & wit cuma\u00f0 to him & mid him wunia\u00f0 Her we magon gehiran, \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend lufa\u00f0 swi\u00f0or \u00fea d\u00e6de \u00feonne \u00fea sme\u00f0an word: \u00fea word gewita\u00f0 Be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 Iacob, se rihtwisa apostol: Estote factores uerbi & non auditores tantum fallentes Eall swa Iohannes us l\u00e6rde \u00feisum wordum: Filioli mei, non diligamus uerbo neque lingua, sed opere Paulus se apostol be \u00f0am ylcan cw\u00e6\u00f0: Qui dicunt se nosse Dominum, factis autem negant: Hi secga\u00f0, Se man, \u00fee behet geswicennysse yfeles & his wedd to \u00feam syl\u00f0 & awend \u00fe\u00e6t eft, hu m\u00e6g he \u00f0onne Ac man mot on eornost motian wi\u00f0 his Drihten, se \u00fee wyle \u00fe\u00e6t we sprecon mid weorcum wi\u00f0 hine; Lucas se godspellere, se \u00f0e w\u00e6s l\u00e6ce on",
